{"id":"n25091-2-10","stage":3,"title":"전개 · 展开","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25091-2-10-1","ko":"아까 본 드라마 정말 재미있었지?","zh":"刚才看的那个剧真的很好看对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚才，方才，刚刚","explanation":"아까：刚才，方才，刚刚","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65974","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}},{"text":"본","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"본","audio":"/audio/cf476351fc8f8f9d9a3f.mp3"}},{"text":"드라마","meaning":"电视剧，连续剧","explanation":"드라마：电视剧，连续剧","readings":[{"term":"드라마","audio":"/audio/48196dde09d3559f1d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61389","senseId":"1","lemma":"드라마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드라마","audio":"/audio/48196dde09d3559f1d2b.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"재미있었지?","meaning":"有趣，有意思","explanation":"재미있다：有趣，有意思；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"재미있다","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71212","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재미있었지","audio":"/audio/4979e2f0fb97c0f04212.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚才，方才，刚刚","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65974","definition":"不久以前。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"48196dde09d3559f","term":"드라마","zh":"电视剧，连续剧","audio":"/audio/48196dde09d3559f1d2b.mp3","entryId":"61389","definition":"在影院上映或电视上播放的剧。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"e2360d9fd7642ddd","term":"재미있다","zh":"有趣，有意思","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3","entryId":"71212","definition":"有欢欣愉悦的感觉。","pronunciation":["재미읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/510bf80de026b73f747c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25091-2-10-2","ko":"응. 다음 회에서는 이야기의 전개가 어떻게 이루어질지 궁금해.","zh":"嗯。我很好奇下一集剧情会如何发展。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"다음","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}},{"text":"회에서는","meaning":"次 ，场 ，回 ，期","explanation":"회：次 ，场 ，回 ，期；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"회","audio":"/audio/0ef6c01e0a84b27b585e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73241","senseId":"1","lemma":"회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회에서는","audio":"/audio/0c916adbdae89af3e520.mp3"}},{"text":"이야기의","meaning":"故事","explanation":"이야기：故事；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"이야기","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60321","senseId":"1","lemma":"이야기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이야기의","audio":"/audio/b09be7d34cc211504c67.mp3"}},{"text":"전개가","meaning":"展开","explanation":"전개：展开；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"전개","audio":"/audio/6c5d28f374714fc29195.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25091","senseId":"2","lemma":"전개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전개가","audio":"/audio/5a785efe87f08e5295d2.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"이루어질지","meaning":"实现，完成","explanation":"이루어지다：实现，完成；ㄹ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"이루어지다","audio":"/audio/1890e18ab93b5a9d8b8b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71690","senseId":"2","lemma":"이루어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이루어질지","audio":"/audio/2e24cd039744774a1f0e.mp3"}},{"text":"궁금해.","meaning":"好奇，纳闷儿","explanation":"궁금하다：好奇，纳闷儿；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"궁금하다","audio":"/audio/8aa230c6a19b7e60293f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"35136","senseId":"1","lemma":"궁금하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"궁금해","audio":"/audio/32a3185a8c8534ba6fe1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"0ef6c01e0a84b27b","term":"회","zh":"次 ，场 ，回 ，期","audio":"/audio/0ef6c01e0a84b27b585e.mp3","entryId":"73241","definition":"计算次数的单位。","pronunciation":["회","훼"]},{"id":"ffe0179e59e74069","term":"이야기","zh":"故事","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3","entryId":"60321","definition":"说或写给别人的关于某个事实、状态、现象、经验、想法等的话或文章。","pronunciation":["이야기"]},{"id":"6c5d28f374714fc2","term":"전개","zh":"展开","audio":"/audio/6c5d28f374714fc29195.mp3","entryId":"25091","definition":"具体内容被进行并开展。","pronunciation":["전ː개"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"1890e18ab93b5a9d","term":"이루어지다","zh":"实现，完成","audio":"/audio/1890e18ab93b5a9d8b8b.mp3","entryId":"71690","definition":"变成如所愿或所想的。","pronunciation":["이루어지다"]},{"id":"8aa230c6a19b7e60","term":"궁금하다","zh":"好奇，纳闷儿","audio":"/audio/8aa230c6a19b7e60293f.mp3","entryId":"35136","definition":"非常想知道。","pronunciation":["궁금하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d07c2f96b5253d282cd4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.745,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25091","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":96,"sequenceScore":2.5717,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯。我很好奇下一集剧情会如何发展。","刚才有谁大声喊叫了吗？","刚才看的那个剧真的很好看对吧？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["嗯。我很好奇下一集剧情会如何发展。","刚才看的那个剧真的很好看对吧？","刚才有谁大声喊叫了吗？"],"answer":0}]}
